Subject: [PATCH] Payme (Telegram Payments) to'lov oqimini qo'shish

- prisma: Order'ga paymentStatus/telegramChargeId/providerChargeId/paidAt
  maydonlari va PaymentStatus enum + migratsiya
- config: PAYMENT_PROVIDER_TOKEN o'qiladigan bo'ldi
- core/bot.js: sendOrderInvoice/buildOrderPayload/parseOrderPayload
- botController: pre_checkout_query va successful_payment handlerlari
  (summani serverda qayta tekshiradi, to'lovni bazaga yozadi)
- bot.routes: yangi handlerlar ro'yxatdan o'tkazildi
- cartController: PAYMENT_PROVIDER_TOKEN bo'lsa buyurtmadan keyin Payme
  hisob-fakturasi yuboriladi, bo'lmasa eski naqd oqim ishlaydi
- mini-app: muvaffaqiyat ekrani to'lov holatiga qarab matn ko'rsatadi
- admin-panel: buyurtmalar jadvalida "To'lov" ustuni qo'shildi

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
